    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Vault denials",
      "description": "Vault audit records carrying a `permission denied` error \u2014 a principal reached for something its policy does not grant. Non-zero is not automatically bad (a probing script, a stale token) but every one should be explicable.",
