      "type": "table",
      "title": "Heaviest units in window",
      "description": "Ranked by bytes, not lines \u2014 that is what you pay for. This is the panel that makes a runaway logger obvious. `conduit.service` sitting at the top is expected and is exactly the duplication called out in the header.",
