    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SPIRE federation heartbeat",
      "description": "Each SPIRE server polling its peer's trust bundle, split by which node did the polling and which trust domain it fetched. Both directions should be continuously present \u2014 gcp refreshing `viaduct.aws` and aws refreshing `viaduct.gcp`, roughly every 75s.\n\n**This exists only in logs.** No metric covers federation liveness, so a silent half of this panel is the earliest warning that cross-cloud trust is decaying \u2014 well before an SVID actually fails to validate.",
