    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Vault paths touched",
      "description": "Every secret path reached in the window, with the operation and the role that reached it. This is the audit question \u2014 *who read what* \u2014 answered directly. `kv/data/*/grafana` is the observability credential; `kv/data/wireguard/peers/*` is mesh registration; `auth/token/renew-self` is routine token upkeep.",
