      "description": "Successful publickey logins, with user, source and key type pulled out by a named-capture `regexp` stage and reformatted. Backtick-quoted so the regex needs no escaping.\n\nExpected sources: `35.235.240.0/20` on GCP (that is IAP), the SSM agent on AWS, and your mesh address `10.99.0.4` on Hetzner. Anything else is the finding.",
